OL,3,GNEWSAShop workers fear confronting
OL,4,Athieves - manager
OL,5,
OL,6,FRetail workers are fearful of
OL,7,Fconfronting shoplifters, according to a
OL,8,Fsupermarket manager who says staff are
OL,9,Ffacing high levels of abuse and
OL,10,Fintimidation.
OL,12,FHarry Delves, who manages Tuffins
OL,13,Fsupermarket in Craven Arms, Shropshire,
OL,14,Fsaid employees have been threatened and
OL,15,Fverbally abused by thieves, leaving
OL,16,Fretailers wary of asking staff to
OL,17,Fintervene.
OL,19,F"It would have have to take an incident
OL,20,Fof quite a serious nature to get them
OL,21,Finterested," he said of police
OL,22,Fresponses to reports of shoplifting.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
